  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……果穂、どうした？\r\n頼みたいもの、決まったか？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007010010,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あ、えっと……！　そのっ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900701/2009007010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……海ロケの打ち合わせは、ご飯を食べながらでもできる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、遠慮せず食べたいものを頼んでいいんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007010020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……食べたいもの……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "r",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900701/2009007010020",
    "voiceKeep": true
  },
  {
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、果穂は何が気になってるんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007010030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、お子様ランチにしたいです……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900701/2009007010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007010040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも……\r\nメニューに小学生以下って書いてあって……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900701/2009007010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007010050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしが12歳だって信じてもらえるでしょうか……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900701/2009007010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そういえば──\r\n俺も最初、高校生と思って果穂に声をかけたんだった）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん、果穂の心配もわかる\r\nもし信じてもらえなかったらと思うと悲しいよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、安心してくれ\r\n果穂は小学生ですって、俺がちゃんと伝えるから",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫だぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007010060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "──はい！　ありがとうございますっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900701/2009007010060"
  },
  {
