    "voice": "produce_events/200900701/2009007010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、俺も驚いた。こんなことあるんだなぁ……\r\nこれはダブルで嬉しいやつだな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007010140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへっ……はい！\r\nお子様ランチが頼めて、応援もしてもらっちゃいました！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900701/2009007010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007010150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "とっても、とーってもうれしいです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
